 "runtime": {
  "ready_timeout_s": 7200,
  "poll_s": 10,
  "point_timeout_s": 3600
 },
 "notes": "InferenceX's kimik3-fp4-mi355x-vllm-agentic-mtp at concurrency 48 (96 sequences, graphs to 480 tokens, DSpark k4 with its synthetic acceptance, KV offload to DRAM), as AgentX serves it (quick reduce NONE); TP8, DCP8. Both modes serve on stack.json's AITER, which has the aiter.plugin AKLR serves AITER's ops through; the hub holds Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark beside the model."
